    "category_specific_evidence": [
      "In IEEE 754, 0 * inf = NaN; in interval arithmetic an endpoint of zero makes the product zero (commit message).",
      "Bug: get_bounds() returned NaN for expressions like nonneg_var * nonpos_var with bounds [0, inf] * [-inf, 0] (commit message and PR body).",
