      "Fix computes each endpoint product under np.errstate(invalid='ignore') and replaces NaN results with 0.0 (diff).",
      "NaN replacement handles sparse matrices by operating on p.data and dense arrays via np.where(np.isnan(...)) (diff).",
      "Commit 'Suppress RuntimeWarning from 0 * inf in mul_bounds' indicates the invalid-operation RuntimeWarning was suppressed (commit message).",
      "Test test_mul_bounds_zero_times_inf checks [0, inf] * [0, inf] gives lb 0.0 and ub inf, not NaN (test_diff).",
